{"title":"","link":"https://bradbarrish.com/2025/12/28/this-photosexport-tool-from-rui.html","date":1766906197000,"content":"<p>This <a href=\"https://github.com/rcarmo/PhotosExport\">PhotosExport</a> tool from <a href=\"https://carmo.io/\">Rui Carmo</a> looks really great. I just exported my Google Photos library using Takeout and am consolidating everything on an instance of <a href=\"https://immich.app/\">Immich</a> on <a href=\"https://www.pikapods.com/\">PikaPods</a>.</p>","author":"","siteTitle":"Brad Barrish","siteHash":"91e49f51884b2947fac16e947ba7e59fe5a24800befb4760d388da1b057f4f23","entryHash":"fa1ff12855717217525d6cadc70aeb1ffe5aef11885e95358da26eeab8cbc8d9","category":"Sites"}